BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jammin' for Jackie: Conversational Canvassing Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T120000
UID:441882c95b3968977779669087d2e324@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Screenshot%202026-08-13%20112105_20260813182135292444.png
DESCRIPTION:Want to help Jackie Elward win her Assembly seat? Looking for 
 ways to feel more confident when you canvass? Come jam with us! Join us as
  we learn to comfortably share our personal stories and connect authentica
 lly with strangers. Build your skills in starting friendly\, meaningful co
 nversations on voters' front porches. Our workshop will focus on the needs
  of Marin County voters. It will take place in a private home in Northern 
 San Rafael\, near Highway 101\, with plenty of easy\, flat parking. Toge
LOCATION:San Rafael\, CA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/ca-wfp/event/1008745/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petaluma Postcard Pod
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260825T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260825T180000
UID:738fac4d4da44df05b6d87a1ca7e2828@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/PostcardPod%20Logo_20250624044140514105_20260810162111805547.
 png
DESCRIPTION:Join us to write postcards to voters across the country\, remi
 nding them of their essential super-power: voting! We work with campaigns 
 on both state and national level. We've written to elect judges\, council 
 members\, Senators\, Representatives\, Assemblypeople\, Governors. We are 
 working to preserve and protect democracy\, so we write mainly to Democrat
  or Independent voters. We have all the supplies\, just bring a favorite p
 en and $15 for the packet of 15 postcards\, stamps and instructions. We're
  a 
LOCATION:Aqus Café at Foundry Wharf\, 189 H St.\, Petaluma\, CA\, 94952
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblesonomacounty/event/1007204/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
