BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Doorstep Democracy: Learn how to canvass\, phone and text to win!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T170000
UID:b1a6643e6b8d5ee659301e43e72c8bb2@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Doorstep%20Democracy%20-%20Mobilize_20260821162657927251.png
DESCRIPTION:Our democracy\, economic well being and planet have never been
  threatened with such ferocity. This means we need to be even more fierce 
 to save it. It is critical we win the fall elections! Spend a day learning
  how to have the biggest impact on elections. This Conference will give yo
 u new skills and confidence to knock on doors\, talk to your neighbors and
  help elect progressives that will change the balance of power in this cou
 nty in November. No prior experience? No problem! Door knocked before?
LOCATION:Plumbers Hall\, 3473 Santa Rosa Ave\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95407
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblesonomacounty/event/1010581/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
