  to gather with a community of progressive folks active in grassroots acti
 ons. This is a time for democracy and each of us has something to contribu
 te to this existential responsibility that rests on all of us. We will be 
 there and hope you will be too. In-person event (no Zoom). Doors open at 1
 0am.
